OL,5,G0000 6 Music's Rave Forever
OL,6,     FGet lost in the hypnotic beats of
OL,7,     FWilliam Orbit's legendary label,
OL,8,     FGuerilla Records.
OL,9,G0100 Forever Dark
OL,10,     F6 Music takes you to the dark side
OL,11,     Fwith the finest goth, electronic
OL,12,     Fand dark pop music, featuring
OL,13,     FPatriarchy, Primal Scream, Keeley
OL,14,     FForsyth, Red Lorry Yellow Lorry
OL,15,     Fand more.
OL,16,G0200 Focus Beats
OL,17,     FJump-start the week with a mix of
OL,18,     Fseamlessly blended beats. Iconic
OL,19,     Fproductions sit alongside brand
OL,20,     Fnew instrumentals, with tracks
OL,21,     Ffrom Busta Rhymes, Yussef Dayes
OL,22,     Fand Miranda Joan.
